Z||000000||grgoyl86||10-06-2001||04:29 PM||||We had a GREAT time at Tech Day today. We learned all about A/C conversions, had some great conversation, saw some great Fieros, ate some great food.<P>An extra special thanks to the Gilbert Family for having us!<P>We'll have some more pictures soon. Here are a few samples.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P0003098a.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P0003116a.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P0003119a.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P0003139a.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P0003153a.jpg"> <P>||||reg||10
