Z||000002||Haagster||10-06-2001||06:49 PM||||Much thanks to the Gilbert family for hosting this event.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature_8.jpg"> <BR>87GT||||reg||6
