Z||000004||Joe Torma||10-06-2001||07:21 PM||||Yes, many thanks the the Gilberts!  I had a great time!  Learned a bunch too.  <P>Glad to finally meet a bunch of you guys.||||reg||1
Z||000005||grgoyl86||10-06-2001||10:06 PM||||We just realized we don't have any shots of the eating part of the day. Did anyone get any pics of the meal?<P>------------------<BR>Why do we park in driveways and drive on parkways?||||reg||1
Z||000006||skitime||10-06-2001||11:09 PM||||It was a great day! We finally got home at 11pm.  Thanks Gilberts for all the work and entertainment.  Jim thanks for finding the leak in my AC system.  It was very easy to find after following the instructions.  We really enjoyed meeting all the new people too.  We had over 27 Fieros there and the total number of Fieros owned by those attending was over 67. WOW <P>Joe Trorma - thanks for coming and look forward to seeing your 3400 engine sometime.<P>Grinthock - Thanks for coming all the way from Ontario Canada. It was great meeting you and having you stay here with us.  You are welcome anytime. Maybe Carlisle next year. <P>Mike - Thanks so much for the wiring harness.  That was great of you for getting it for me.<P>Everyone please post pics. We forgot our camera today.  (Thanks Bob for the pics)<P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-2.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000007||foxgapfiero||10-07-2001||07:46 AM||||What a great day! I had just had my AC converted, but I learned that I could have gone farther with the conversion and possibly got a job that will last longer. We would have liked to stay longer, but another stop waited for us. Next time I'll make sure everything on the calendar is cleared.  Thanks again to all for having us<P>------------------<BR>Mark Hoagland<BR>86GT 3.4<BR>88GT T-Top<BR>85GT caddy v-8 next swap<BR>84SE trailer next project||||reg||1
Z||000008||Denny||10-07-2001||08:35 AM||||My warmest thanks to the Gilbert clan for being such wonderful hosts! Thanks! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>OK folks, I'm sure you've all been waiting for them, especially since Bob (Gargoyle86) posted the teaser yesterday, so here's the album:  <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=34301&a=13840558&f=0" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=34301&a=13840558&f=0</A> <P>I'm going to solicit help <FONT COLOR="red"><B>(Fierochic88?)</FONT></B> in captioning some of them, especially to identify some of the participants by their forum name.<P>Enjoy!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif"> ||||reg||10
Z||000009||grgoyl86||10-07-2001||11:58 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by skitime:<BR><B>Everyone please post pics. We forgot our camera today.  (Thanks Bob for the pics)<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Actually, thank Denny. Those were his pictures, I just jumped in there and grabbed them and posted them.  8^)<BR>Check out the rest of his pictures at the album address he listed above.<P>So, when are we gonna do this again?    8^)<BR>||||reg||12
