Z||000012||Fierochic88||10-07-2001||08:07 PM||||Thanks for coming everyone and hope you all had a wonderful time!  We enjoyed having you all!<P>Congratulations to our road rally winners:<P>Joe Rebilas & Bruce Walters - 1st Place<BR>(FieroGT914)<P>Mike Shirk & Jason Haughey (Fiero38) - 2nd Place<P>Justin Cohen (Grinthock) & Don Haag (Haagster) - 3rd Place<P>Jennifer<P>We really enjoyed our photo shoot too!<P>------------------<BR>IM Username:  FieroChic88<BR>Silver 1988 GT<BR>Silver 1986 2m4<BR>Cobalt Blue 85 GT<P>     <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/jenscar-sig1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000013||TooManyFieros||10-08-2001||07:28 AM||||I really had a great time. Enjoyed meeting all those that I only talked to on this forum. Always a pleasure to host Fiero people. I have to tell you that I was disapointed though. I was so busy talking and spraying my cold stuff that I didn't win a door prize. And I really could have used a new door for my train room.    Later TooManyFieros<p>[This message has been edited by TooManyFieros (edited 10-08-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000014||grinthock||10-08-2001||07:51 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by TooManyFieros:<BR><B>I really had a great time. Enjoyed meeting all those that I only talked to on this forum. Always a pleasure to host Fiero people. I have to tell you that I was disapointed though. I was so busy talking and spraying my cold stuff that I didn't win a door prize. And I really could have used a new door for my train room.    Later TooManyFieros<P>[This message has been edited by TooManyFieros (edited 10-08-2001).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You really did love that stuff didn't you Jim!  When you get your door done on the Train room let me know, I would love to come down for a weekend and help you work on it.  it's been years.||||reg||1
Z||000015||grgoyl86||10-08-2001||11:35 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by TooManyFieros:<BR><B>I really had a great time. Enjoyed meeting all those that I only talked to on this forum. Always a pleasure to host Fiero people. I have to tell you that I was disapointed though. I was so busy talking and spraying my cold stuff that I didn't win a door prize. And I really could have used a new door for my train room.    Later TooManyFieros<P>[This message has been edited by TooManyFieros (edited 10-08-2001).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I think I still have some big sheets of cardboard . . . .<P><P>------------------<BR>Why do we park in driveways and drive on parkways?||||reg||1
Z||000016||kslish||10-09-2001||04:11 AM||||I'm still trying to catch up on these forum threads since arriving back home on Monday.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Even though I arrived late on Saturday (which is a good thing because Lisa would have probably had been completely unconcious if we hadn't of slept in) I enjoyed seeing new faces and old friends.  Great seeing you again Bob, Dave, the entire Gilbert family, Denny, Joe R. and on and on...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>For those of you that I may not have met directly...I was the dude that was hanging out with Jim at the final checkpoint of the road rally.<P>Special thanks go to the Gilbert family for putting me up and sharing their fantastic house and keeping me well fed.  Mmmmm...that grilled chicken on Sunday.  Good stuff...  <P>Also a big thanks to Joe R. for letting me get my Fiero fix for the weekend while I was away from mine.  I had to pry your keys away from Lisa, but she got to drive three other ones on Saturday!  That paranoid look on your face when you saw me behind the wheel was classic though.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <P><P>------------------<BR>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR>See them at <A HREF="http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html</A><BR>Western PA Fiero Club - <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A>||||reg||1
Z||000017||FieroGT 914||10-11-2001||11:23 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by kslish:<BR><B>I'm still trying to catch up on these forum threads since arriving back home on Monday.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Also a big thanks to Joe R. for letting me get my Fiero fix for the weekend while I was away from mine.  I had to pry your keys away from Lisa, but she got to drive three other ones on Saturday!  That paranoid look on your face when you saw me behind the wheel was classic though.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey Ken, I'm still catchin up too... good to hear you and Lisa enjoyed driving my GT and glad you liked the paranoid look on my face too - I've seen how you drive!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Joe<P>         <IMG SRC="http://www.personal.psu.edu/users/j/j/jjr161/FieroGT914_Signature.gif">          <BR>AOL I.M.: FieroGT 914<BR>White 86 GT (Stock)<BR>Maroon 87 GT (Mod)<BR><A HREF="http://www.personal.psu.edu/~jjr161" TARGET=_blank>My Website</A>||||reg||1
